+Range reviewed: `ace0df1..HEAD` (fix commits `bbb742a`, `b086a30`).
+
+Human decisions after round 2 (Gate 3):
+- R-01: fix now.
+- R-06: fix now.
+- R-04: load the Swiper CSS globally and restore the 6/8 kB `anyComponentStyle` budget.
+- R-03: accepted as Won't fix, the same decision as US-01 R-17.
